  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.char": "巡回騎士よ。満月の夜はまだ終わっていない。町のみんなが帰りを待っているの。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.next": "続ける",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-2r.ancient": "ならば帰るがいい、赤ずきん。狼を待たせすぎるなよ。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.ancient": "またお前か。祖母は元気か？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.next": "答える",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.char": "おばあちゃんから伝言よ。「邪魔しないで」だって。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.next": "続ける",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-2r.ancient": "……大した祖母だな。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.ancient": "お前の誓いは、この塔よりも頑固だ。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.next": "答える",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.char": "月光に誓って——約束は破らない。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.next": "続ける",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-2r.ancient": "では見せてもらおう。月光はどこまで届くのか。"
